<title>EGYPT: Arafat leaves Cairo for EU meeting in Luxembourg.</title>
<headline>Arafat leaves Cairo for EU meeting in Luxembourg.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat left on Monday for Luxembourg after day-long talks with Egypt's President Hosni Mubarak on plans to attend a Middle East summit in Washington, airport officials said.</p>
</text>
